## Story Generic Activity Flow

1. Understand MVI (Minimum Viable Input provided)
2. Choose Appropriate Template.
3. Elaborate Story Manifest in the Objective, Purpose, Story Overview, in the comment box.
4. Divide your Story in 5d Activity Stages, in the comment box.
5. Create Tasks for each sub-story, in the task box.
6. Create a Roadmap in a comment box, in the relevant folder in the current repo. Create a new branch for projects and modules.
7. Add due date.
8. Change status to InAction.
9. Add in Comments, either content or link to file.
10. Finish the story, write commit message with task ID in it.
11. Make a push.
12. Let appropriate people know.
13. Get Approvals at the end of each stage.

